seg-c9d00ff2e1d0 = A submission is a file (<c1/>): <c2/> (one number per case id; higher is more likely impaired) for tasks a, b and d, or <c3/> (the phase change in ns at each horizon) for task c. A result file (<c4/>) names the spec version, the split, the SHA-256 of the truth and of the predictions, and the metrics. Results of different major spec versions are never put in one table.

